xpression is equivalent to&nbsp;<math alttext=\"8 Superscript 10 Baseline x minus 8 Superscript 9 Baseline x plus 88 x\"><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>10</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>88</mn><mi>x</mi></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect. This expression is equivalent to <math alttext=\"8 x Superscript 11 minus 8 x Superscript 10 plus 88 x squared\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mn>8</mn>\n\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t<mn>11</mn>\n\t\t</msup>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mn>8</mn>\n\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t<mn>10</mn>\n\t\t</msup>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mn>88</mn>\n\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t</msup>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math>.</p>","stem":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Which of the following expressions is equivalent to <math alttext=\"8 x Superscript 10 minus 8 x Superscript 9 plus 88 x\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mn>8</mn>\n\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t<mn>10</mn>\n\t\t</msup>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mn>8</mn>\n\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t<mn>9</mn>\n\t\t</msup>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mn>88</mn>\n\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math>?</p>","type":"mcq","correct_answer":["D"]},"createDate":1730147357394,"updateDate":1730147357394}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1730147357394, 1730147357394),
