ic\">x</span> yields <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/364a2d25/img_010_1d4468f6.png\" alt=\"x equals 8\"></span> and <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/364a2d25/img_011_5a3064af.png\" alt=\"x equals 9\"></span> respectively. Note that 8 and 9 are examples of ways to enter a correct answer.</p>\n","answer_style":"SPR","section":"Math","image_count":12,"raw_list":{"updateDate":1691007959631,"pPcc":"SAT#P","questionId":"364a2d25","skill_cd":"P.B.","score_band_range_cd":4,"skill_desc":"Nonlinear equations in one variable and systems of equations in two variables ","createDate":1691007959631,"program":"SAT","primary_class_cd_desc":"Advanced Math","ibn":"070619-DC","external_id":null,"primary_class_cd":"P","uId":"9efbeae5-8e99-4366-a2a0-ed3555c3a34b","difficulty":"M"},"raw_detail":{"item_id":"070619-DC","section":"Math","body":"<div xmlns=\"http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/apip/apipv1p0/qtiitem/imsqti_v2p1\" class=\"stimulus_reference \">\n        <p class=\"standalone_statement style:1 \">\n          <span class=\"math_expression \">\n            <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"Equation 1: x plus y equals 17. Equation 2: x y equals 72.\"></span>\n          </span>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n","prompt":"<p class=\"stem_paragraph \">If one solution to the system of equations above is <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"the ordered pair x comma y \"></span>, what is one possible value of <span class=\"italic\">x</span> ?</p>\n","answer":{"style":"SPR","rationale":"<p>The correct answer is either 8 or 9. The first equation can be rewritt