<p style="text-align: left;">The graph of <math alttext="y equals f left parenthesis x right parenthesis plus 4"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></math> is shown. Which equation defines function <math alttext="f"><mi>f</mi>
</math>?</p>$SATQ$, $SATQ$[{"id":"1dde39c0-a675-4d5d-bd13-eb1af3cea192","content":"<p><math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals minus 3 Superscript x Baseline plus 1\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t<mn>3</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</msup>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t<mn>1</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"95725087-35ef-431f-a4cc-7ad8a82c23df","content":"<p><math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals minus 3 Superscript x Baseline plus 5\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t<mn>3</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</msup>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t<mn>5</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"7e5cf783-70b7-4653-9ed9-8d22e5be114f","content":"<p><math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals minus 3 Superscript x Baseline plus 8\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t<mn>3</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</msup>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t<mn>8</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"f321f3fc-af5f-46ad-ae57-66ba0fbc3ef3","content":"<p><math alttext=\"f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals minus 3 Superscript x Baseline plus 9\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t<mn>3</mn>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t</msup>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t<mn>9</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>"}]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["B"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["95725087-35ef-431f-a4cc-7ad8a82c23df"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$<p>Choice B is correct. The graph of&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="y equals f left parenthesis x right parenthesis plus 4"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></math> is shown, and the graph passes through the point <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="left parenthesis 0 comma 8 right parenthesis"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0,</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. Substituting&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="0"><mn>0</mn></math> for&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="x"><mi>x</mi></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="8"><mn>8</mn></math> for&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="y"><mi>y</mi></math> in this equation yields <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="8 equals f left parenthesis 0 right parenthesis plus 4"><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></math>. Subtracting&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="4"><mn>4</mn></math> from both sides of this equation yields <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="4 equals f left parenthesis 0 right parenthesis"><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></math>. Therefore, when <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="x equals 0"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="f left parenthesis x right parenthesis"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="4"><mn>4</mn></math>. Each of the given choices is in the form <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals minus 3 Superscript x Baseline plus k"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></math>, where&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="k"><mi>k</mi></math> is a constant. Substituting&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="0"><mn>0</mn></math> for&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="x"><mi>x</mi></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="4"><mn>4</mn></math> for&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="f left parenthesis x right parenthesis"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> in this equation yields <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="4 equals minus 3 Superscript 0 Baseline plus k"><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></math>, or <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="4 equals negative 1 plus k"><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></math>. Adding&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="1"><mn>1</mn></math> to both sides of this equation yields <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="5 equals k"><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi></math>. Substituting&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="5"><mn>5</mn></math> for&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="k"><mi>k</mi></math> in the equation <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals minus 3 Superscript x Baseline plus k"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></math> yields <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals minus 3 Superscript x Baseline plus 5"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></math>.</p>
<p>Choice A is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>
<p>Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>
<p>Choice D is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>$SATQ$, false, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, $SATQ${"questionId":"36b6f8ba","external_id":"7a673830-c24f-450c-9dbf-0cbce334c119","disclosed_item_id":null,"source":"qbank","vaultid":null,"uId":"699060a0-f42d-41f6-973a-cc84602eeadf","program":"SAT","test_type":2,"test_type_desc":"Math","primary_class_cd":"P","domain":"Advanced Math","skill_cd":"P.C.","skill_desc":"Nonlinear functions","difficulty":"H","score_band_range_cd":7,"type":"mcq","stimulus":null,"stem":"<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><figure class='image'><svg version=\"1.0.0\" width=\"370px\" height=\"336.328125px\" viewBox=\"0 0 370 336.328125\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" role=\"img\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-label=\"Graph of a curve in the x y plane with the origin labeled O. The x axis ranges from negative 1 to 5. The y axis ranges from negative 5 to 10. Refer to long description.\"><defs><marker id=\"arrow\" viewBox=\"0 -3 10 6\" markerUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" markerWidth=\"10px\" markerHeight=\"6px\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,-3 L10,0 L0,3\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></marker></defs><g class=\"graph-group\" transform=\"translate(25, 25)\"><g class=\"grid-group\"><g class=\"x-grid\"><line x1=\"66.8013599537037\" y1=\"311.328125\" x2=\"66.8013599537037\" y2=\"0\" stroke=\"#757576\" stroke-width=\"0\" class=\"x-grid\"></line><line x1=\"22.120008680555554\" y1=\"311.328125\" x2=\"22.120008680555554\" y2=\"0\" stroke=\"#757576\" stroke-width=\"1px\" class=\"x-grid\"></line><line x1=\"66.8013599537037\" y1=\"311.328125\" x2=\"66.8013599537037\" y2=\"0\" stroke=\"#757576\" stroke-width=\"0\" class=\"x-grid\"></line><line x1=\"111.48271122685185\" y1=\"311.328125\" x2=\"111.48271122685185\" y2=\"0\" stroke=\"#757576\" stroke-width=\"1px\" class=\"x-grid\"></line><line x1=\"156.1640625\" y1=\"311.328125\" x2=\"156.1640625\" y2=\"0\" stroke=\"#757576\" stroke-width=\"1px